          {
            "title": "append()",
            "id": 79676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listeye <code>25</code> değerini eklemek için liste adını, ardından bir nokta <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>append(25)</code> talimatını yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"23\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.append(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[24, 23, 25]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>append</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>25</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listenin sonuna değer eklemek için liste adını, ardından bir nokta <code>.</code> ve sonra değeri parantez içinde alan <code>append</code> metodunu yazarız.</p><p><code>scores</code> listesinin <code>[24, 23, 25]</code> yazdırması için sonuna <code>25</code> sayısını ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"23\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores.append(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;25&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[24, 23, 25]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>append</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>25</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "append()",
            "id": 79675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.append()</code> ile bir değer eklemek, onu listenin sonuna yerleştirir. Burada <code>print(users)</code> kodunu yazarak sonucu görebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;john&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;marco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>users</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.append()</code> ile bir değer eklemek, bu değeri listenin sonuna yerleştirir.</p><p>Konsolda <code>['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']</code> görünmesi için listenin tamamını görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;john&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;marco&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;julian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['john', 'hannah', 'marco', 'julian']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>users</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "insert()",
            "id": 79674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>insert()</code> ile belirli bir dizine değer ekleriz. <code>insert(0, \"lemon\")</code> yazarak değeri listenin başına ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>insert</code>, ardından <code>(0, \"lemon\")</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>insert()</code> ile belirli bir indekse değer ekleriz. İlk argümanı indeks, ikinci argümanı ise değerdir.</p><p><code>shopping</code> listesinin <code>['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']</code> yazdırması için başına <code>\"lemon\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>insert</code>, ardından <code>0</code> ve son olarak <code>\"lemon\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Insert()",
            "id": 80441,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>insert()</code> fonksiyonunun iki parametresi vardır. Önce değeri eklemek istediğimiz dizini, ardından değeri belirtiriz.</p><p><code>insert(1, \"chocolate\")</code> ikinci konuma bir değer ekler.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>insert</code>, ardından <code>1</code> ve sonra <code>,</code>, <code>\"chocolate\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>insert()</code> fonksiyonunun iki parametresi vardır: değerin ekleneceği indeks ve virgülle ayrılan değerin kendisi.</p><p>Listenin <code>['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']</code> yazdırması için ikinci öğe olarak <code>\"chocolate\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;kiwis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;peas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;lemon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"shopping.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(shopping)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['lemon', 'chocolate', 'kiwis', 'peas']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>insert</code>, ardından <code>1</code>, <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>\"chocolate\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One at a time",
            "id": 79673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hem <code>append()</code> hem de <code>insert()</code> için aynı anda yalnızca bir öğe ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"initials = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;RM&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LC&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(initials)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>append</code>, ardından <code>insert</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hem <code>append()</code> hem de <code>insert()</code> için aynı anda yalnızca bir öğe ekleyebiliriz.</p><p>Listenin <code>['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']</code> yazdırması için sona <code>\"LC\"</code>, <code>1</code> indeksine <code>\"LS\"</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"initials = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;RM&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LP&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.append(\" /><text value=\"&quot;LC&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"initials.insert(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;LS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(initials)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['RM', 'LS', 'LP', 'LC']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>append</code>, ardından <code>insert</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "pop()",
            "id": 79672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listenin son öğesini kaldırmak için liste adını <code>todo</code>, nokta işaretini <code>.</code> ve <code>pop()</code> talimatını yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"todo.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(todo)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"40\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['call mom']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>pop()</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
