            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kaldırılan değer bir değişkenin içinde de saklanabilir. Bunu, <code>print(removed)</code> kodunu yazdığımızda burada görebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"todo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;painting&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removed = todo.pop(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(removed)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"78\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"call mom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(removed)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
